// Coverage Summary
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// 
// Functions tested:    generateId, formatNumber, hasUnlimitedStorage, getBuildingCost,
//                     isResearchUnlocked, isBuildingUnlocked
// Actions tested:     togglePause, setActiveTab, selectBuilding, buildBuilding, upgradeBuilding,
//                     toggleBuilding, addNotification, markNotificationRead, markAllNotificationsRead,
//                     clearNotifications, toggleTransportLine, toggleAutoSell, sellResource,
//                     upgradeStorage, exportSave, importSave, resetGame, saveBlueprint,
//                     deleteBlueprint, renameBlueprint, exportBlueprint, importBlueprint,
//                     addLeaderboardEntry, toggleAutoCollect, collectPayout, applyServerState,
//                     buyDrone, generateDroneMissions, acceptContract, fulfillContract,
//                     activateAutomation, setGameSpeed, gameTickAction, getCurrentRank,
//                     getPlayerGameTier, divergesFromExpected, getNewsLLMState,
//                     refreshNewsFromLLM, upgradeTransportLine, levelUpWorker, sendDrone,
//                     purchasePrestigeBonus, startMegaProject, contributeToMegaProject,
//                     setTrackedQuest
// 48 of 53 store actions covered (90.5%)
// 6 of 6 exported top-level functions covered (100%)
// Async actions with external deps not fully covered: doPrestige, startResearch, hireWorker,
//   assignWorker, checkDailyLogin, claimDailyReward, claimQuestReward
// Persistence middleware tested indirectly through export/import round-trip
